          "name": "飞掠攻击",
          "expectedDescription": "<p>The sardus endling Strides or Flies twice, making a beak Strike at any point along its movement.</p>",
          "description": "<p>（攻击，移动） 萨杜斯鹭终灵行走或飞行两次，在移动过程中的任意一点进行一次喙打击。</p>"
