          "expectedName": "Motion Sense",
          "name": "运动感知",
          "expectedDescription": "<p>A mannoq beast can sense nearby creatures through vibrations in air or water caused by movement as an imprecise sense at the listed range.</p>",
          "description": "<p>曼诺克兽能在所列范围内以模糊感官通过空气或水中由运动引起的震动感知附近生物。</p>"
        },
        {
