        {
          "id": "FBR1qVyCYYdJMhji",
          "expectedName": "Gene Transfer",
          "name": "基因转移",
          "expectedDescription": "<p>A sapling oracle of Oras can access their stores of genetic information and provide a burst of psychically encoded transformation to all living allies in their telepathic bond. Those allies gain two of the following abilities for 1 minute: burrow 30 feet, darkvision, fly 40 feet, lifesense (imprecise) 60 feet, resistance 5 to physical damage, resistance 10 to one type of energy damage, swim 40 feet, tremorsense (precise) 30 feet, or water breathing.</p>",
          "description": "<p>（原能） 奥拉斯的树先知可以访问其基因信息储备，并向其心灵联结中的所有活体盟友提供一阵心灵编码的转化。这些盟友在1分钟内获得以下能力中的两个：掘地30尺，黑暗视觉，飞行40尺，生命感知（模糊）60尺，物理伤害抗力5，一种能量伤害抗力10，游泳40尺，震颤感知（精确）30尺，或水下呼吸。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "SA411UKFbIhtrBYQ",
          "expectedName": "Latch",
          "name": "拉扯",
          "expectedDescription": "<p>Whenever the sapling oracle of Oras successfully hits a Medium or smaller creature with a vine Strike, they pull that creature 10 feet toward them (20 feet on a critical hit).</p>",
          "description": "<p>每当奥拉斯的树先知以藤蔓打击成功命中一个中型或更小体型的生物时，它们将该生物拉向自己10尺（重击时20尺）。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "XbDRRf8IyZLUt5PL",
          "expectedName": "Telepathic Bond",
          "name": "心灵联结",
          "expectedDescription": "<p>The sapling oracle of Oras links their senses to all other willing living creatures within 100 feet for 10 minutes. While linked to at least one ally, the oracle can't be flanked.</p>",
          "description": "<p>（专注，原能） 奥拉斯的树先知将其感官与100尺内所有其他自愿的活体生物连接，持续10分钟。当与至少一个盟友联结时，树先知不能被夹击。</p>"
