        },
        {
          "id": "oiWnO9zyXrr5rewh",
          "expectedName": "Szandite Siphon",
          "name": "桑迪特虹吸",
          "expectedDescription": "<p>The szandite crystal structure on a glibraiaxʼs body provides it with near-perfect memory and lightning-fast linguistic processing. The glibraiax can permanently read and speak all languages known by creatures that come within range of its telepathy, and can perfectly recall all events, conversations, and thoughts it experiences.</p>",
          "description": "<p>水晶虫身上的桑迪特水晶结构赋予其近乎完美的记忆和闪电般的语言处理能力。水晶虫可以永久读写进入其心灵感应范围内生物所知的所有语言，并能完美回忆其经历的所有事件、对话和思想。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "JwmfdoLuhlCd86kJ",
          "expectedName": "Colony Mind",
          "name": "虫群心智",
          "expectedDescription": "<p>30 feet. All allies with colony mind within the listed range of each other are in constant telepathic communication and are aware of all threats any individual knows about. While within range of at least one ally with colony mind, when a creature rolls a success on a save against a mental effect, it gets a critical success instead.</p>",
          "description": "<p>（灵光） 30尺。所有处于彼此范围内的虫群心智盟友能够进行持续的心灵沟通，并且彼此知道对方察觉到的所有威胁。如果此生物处于至少一个具有虫群心智的盟友的范围内，则其在对抗心灵效果的豁免上掷骰出成功时，改为获得大成功。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "PhEiGNltwgGMeoDV",
